      "In an executive address streamed globally from OpenAI's San Francisco headquarters, engineering leadership showcased live demonstrations of Astra orchestrating autonomous corporate research pipelines. The model autonomously ingested thousands of pages of SEC filings, executed cross-tabulated Python financial calculations, generated verified audit citations, and compiled production-ready investor dashboards in less than four minutes. Crucially, the company demonstrated a new verification framework that significantly suppresses hallucination rates during mathematical synthesis and statutory compliance tasks.",
