      "The program represents the first time a leading artificial intelligence developer has allowed external, independent researchers to inspect model weights, intermediate activation states, and alignment safety boundaries prior to public release. The embedded researchers are tasked with assessing high-consequence risk vectors, including autonomous replication capabilities, cyber-offense exploitation, persuasion vulnerabilities, and algorithmic deception, establishing empirical safety benchmarks ahead of commercial deployment.",
